const isWeekOverview = ref(isTeacher.value);
const weekViewTeacherId = ref('');
```

---

## Teacher filter UI (template)

**Toolbar (director only, week view):** room select, teacher search, student search; plus **週檢視** teacher **chips** when `isWeekOverview && visibleTeachers.length > 1`.

```58:88:frontend/src/pages/SmartCalendar.vue
          <div class="toolbar-secondary-line toolbar-secondary-line--filters">
            <div class="toolbar-secondary-mid">
              <div class="toolbar-filters">
                <select v-model="roomFilter" class="filter-select toolbar-room-select" title="依教室篩選老師欄">
                  <option value="">全部教室</option>
                  <option v-for="r in allRoomOptions" :key="r" :value="r">教室 {{ r }}</option>
                </select>
                <input v-model="teacherSearch" type="search" class="filter-input toolbar-search-input" placeholder="搜尋老師…" autocomplete="off" />
                <input v-model="studentSearch" type="search" class="filter-input toolbar-search-input" placeholder="搜尋學生…" autocomplete="off" />
              </div>
              <div
                v-if="isWeekOverview && visibleTeachers.length > 1"
                class="week-teacher-chips"
                role="tablist"
                aria-label="切換週檢視老師"
              >
                <span class="week-teacher-chips-label">老師</span>
                <div class="week-teacher-chips-scroll">
                  <button
                    v-for="t in visibleTeachers"
                    :key="t.id"
                    type="button"
                    role="tab"
                    :aria-selected="String(weekViewTeacherId) === String(t.id)"
                    :class="['week-teacher-chip', { active: String(weekViewTeacherId) === String(t.id) }]"
                    @click="weekViewTeacherId = t.id"
                  >
                    {{ t.username }}
                  </button>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
```

**日檢視:** no chip row; each column is one entry in `visibleTeachers` (lines 147–194).

**週檢視:** context bar for the active teacher (lines 207–211); grid uses `getCoursesForWeekCell` → `weekViewTeacherId` (lines 228–234).

**老師清單 tab:** `teacherGroups` from `filteredCourses` (lines 258–277) — grouped list, not a dropdown filter.

**Modals** (`modalForm.teacher_id`, substitute, extra) use `<option v-for="t in (teachers || [])">` — assignment UI, not the calendar column filter.

---

## Filtering logic (computed + helpers)

1. **`filterTeacherOptions`** (lines 1491–1502): union of `teachers` IDs/names plus any `courses` rows with a real `teacher_name`.

2. **`visibleTeachers`** (lines 1505–1558): starts from `filterTeacherOptions`, adds `roomLabel` / `roomIds`, then filters by:
   - `roomFilter`
   - `teacherSearch` (substring on username)
   - `studentSearch` (intersection with `filteredCourses` teacher IDs, day-scoped in 日檢視)
   - `filterTeacherId` (single teacher)
   - teacher role: only `currentTeacherId`, with fallback row from `courses` if list empty

3. **`filteredCourses`** (lines 1609–1742): starts from `displayWeekFilteredCourses` → `courses`; then:
   - teacher role + non-week viewMode: filter to `currentTeacherId` (lines 1611–1615; week view skips early filter for substitute-merge reasons per comment)
   - **`filterTeacherId`**: keep only matching `c.teacher_id` (lines 1617–1619)
   - week view: heavy merge with `exceptions` (schedules); exception rows respect `filterTeacherId` at lines 1715–1716
   - after merge, teacher role again: `mergedList.filter(teacher_id === teacherScopeId)` (lines 1736–1737)

4. **Per-cell helpers** all read **`filteredCourses`**:
   - `getCoursesForTeacherAt` (lines 1409–1417): day column = `teacherId` + hour + `selectedDow` + student search + cancelled sessions
   - `getCoursesForWeekCell` (lines 1452–1460): `weekViewTeacherId` + dow + hour + student search
   - `getWeekTeacherDayCount` (lines 1463–1466): same teacher + dow

5. **`teacherGroups`** (lines 1749–1761): groups **`filteredCourses`** by `teacher_id` for the “老師清單” view.

---

## Watchers (teacher selection sync)

```2905:2947:frontend/src/pages/SmartCalendar.vue
watch(() => props.initialTeacherId, (id) => {
  if (id != null && id !== '') {
    filterTeacherId.value = String(id);
    weekViewTeacherId.value = String(id);
    emit('clear-initial-teacher');
  }
}, { immediate: true });
watch(visibleTeachers, (list) => {
  if (!Array.isArray(list) || list.length === 0) {
    weekViewTeacherId.value = '';
    return;
  }
  const visibleIds = new Set(list.map(t => String(t.id)));
  if (filterTeacherId.value && !visibleIds.has(String(filterTeacherId.value))) {
    filterTeacherId.value = '';
  }
  if (weekViewTeacherId.value && !visibleIds.has(String(weekViewTeacherId.value))) {
    weekViewTeacherId.value = '';
  }
  if (isWeekOverview.value && !weekViewTeacherId.value) {
    weekViewTeacherId.value = list[0].id;
  }
});
// ...
watch(isWeekOverview, (val) => {
  if (val && !weekViewTeacherId.value && visibleTeachers.value.length) {
    weekViewTeacherId.value = visibleTeachers.value[0].id;
  }
});
watch(isTeacher, (val) => {
  if (val) {
    isWeekOverview.value = true;
  } else if (isWeekOverview.value && !weekViewTeacherId.value) {
    isWeekOverview.value = false;
  }
});
```

---

## Data flow: fetch vs client filter

**Fetch (not filtered by `filterTeacherId` / `weekViewTeacherId`):**

- **Courses:** `loadCourses` uses paginated `GET …/v1/student-classes` with `branch_id` (director) or `teacher_id` (teacher), optional Supabase fallback, then sets `courses` (lines 1766–1817, 1916–1917).
- **Schedules (exceptions):** `GET …/v1/schedules` with date window and same branch/teacher params (lines 1868–1886); fallback Supabase `schedules` (lines 1888–1895).
- **Class session dates:** `fetchClassSessions` after courses load (lines 1921–1931).
- **Teachers list:** `loadTeachers` → `fetch('/api/v1/teachers?…')` with `branch_id` + `strict_branch` for directors (lines 1966–2010).

**Client-side teacher filtering** happens only in computeds (`filteredCourses`, `visibleTeachers`) and chip clicks (`weekViewTeacherId`), plus `initialTeacherId` → `filterTeacherId`.

---

## Teachers list population

- **Primary:** `loadTeachers` → **`GET /api/v1/teachers`**; results stored in **`teachers`** (lines 1966–2010).
- **Augmented in UI:** `filterTeacherOptions` adds teachers that appear only on **`courses`** (e.g. name from API course row) if missing from `teachers` (lines 1491–1502).

---

**Summary:** There is no `selectedTeacher`. Director-facing filters are **`teacherSearch`**, **`roomFilter`**, **`studentSearch`**, **week chip `weekViewTeacherId`**, and parent-driven **`filterTeacherId`** (from **`initialTeacherId`**). **`filteredCourses`** is what actually limits sessions on the grid; fetches load branch- or teacher-scoped data, then these refs narrow the view.

